  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Price</strong> 200 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 1&nbsp;lb.<br>\nBlack powder is both an alchemical reagent and an important component for most firearms. Black powder, being an explosive, is dangerous in large quantities.</p>\n<p><strong>Alchemical Recipe</strong><br>\n<strong>Recipe</strong> ((13 Darkwood) / Calcination) + (75 Saltpeter, 12<br>\nSulfur) / fermentation))<br>\n<strong>Craft</strong> DC 15<br>\n<strong>Time</strong> 1 day<br>\n<strong>Tools</strong> Crucible, Mortar and Pestle<br>\n<strong>Type</strong> fuel (explosive)<br>\n<strong>Special</strong> Unlike other recipes, this recipe produces not 1, but 20 doses of black powder; sufficient enough to fill 2 powder horns.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alchemical-items#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
